      "_id": "a745ca58a40348a0",
      "name": "Invulnerability",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/magic/unholy/silhouette-evil-horned-summon.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>You have become a walking juggernaut. You may perform a Simple Test to negate aggravated wounds, conducting one test per wound level incurred. If you win, you take no damage; on a tie the wound becomes nonaggravated. You cannot continue testing down with Imperviousness after a successful test on Invulnerability.</p>",
        "source": "Laws of Elysium, Disciplines",
